    {
      "id": "node-raw-input",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1020,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce5 Raw User Command / Intent\n- Captures any raw instruction, thesis topic, or code task.\n- Intercepted by **`/omni-auto` Head Meta-Router** before execution.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-token-compressor",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1020,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### \u26a1 Token & Credit Optimizer (Prompt Master Pack)\n- Strips conversational bloat while preserving 100% intent.\n- **Universal 8-Part Template**:\n  - **Role** & **Objective**\n  - **Context** & **Task**\n  - **Inputs** & **Constraints**\n  - **Method** & **Output Format**\n- **\ud83d\udca1 Micro-Learning**: Injects 2-line Prompt Insight.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-evidence-sep",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1020,
      "y": -30,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd0d Evidence Separation Protocol\n- **FACT**: Verified data from Scopus/WoS/files/APIs.\n- **INFERENCE**: Logical deductions derived from evidence.\n- **ASSUMPTION**: Explicitly labeled defaults.\n- **UNKNOWN**: Explicitly marked \"DATA TIDAK TERSEDIA\".",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-triad-bridge",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1020,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd04 AI Agent Triad Collaboration\n- **\ud83e\udd16 Dola**: Autonomous Workflow Engine\n- **\u26a1 Antigravity (AGY)**: Surgical Execution & Code Engine\n- **\ud83c\udf1f Gemini**: SOTA Multimodal Reasoning & Discovery\n- **\ud83e\udde0 Obsidian**: Local Persistent Knowledge Memory Store",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-router",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -450,
