    },
    {
      "id": "node-router-hub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd00 Automated Intent Classifier (S1\u2013S207)\nDynamically routes tasks into the optimal combination of 207 Super-Skills and 18,200+ Sub-Skills without prompt overhead.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cat-acad",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "### \ud83c\udf93 1. Core Academic & Research (S1\u2013S6, S20, S22, S194)\n- `omni-auto` v4.0 \u00b7 `publication-shield` \u00b7 `mendeley-ris-linker`\n- `master-journal-tracking` \u00b7 `markitdown-academic-parser`\n- `kuliah-s2-master-management-curriculum` \u00b7 `ai-research-deep-engine`",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cat-eng",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "### \u2699\ufe0f 2. Engineering, Swarms & Cloud (S7\u2013S14, S21, S173, S185, S201)\n- `agentic-engineering-suite` \u00b7 `master-senior-software-engineer`\n- `ruflow-omniroute-agent-swarms` \u00b7 `founder-railway-cloud-os`\n- `trueforge-agent-harness-platform` \u00b7 `langgraph-orchestrator`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cat-multi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### \ud83c\udf10 3. Multi-Model Gateway & Local Mesh (S206, S207, S189)\n- `ashna-ai-no-code-agent-cloud` (62+ Models via unified gateway)\n- `obsidian-community-plugin-powerhouse` (51 Active Plugins)\n- `lmstudio-developer-local-mesh` (Bionic MCP Bridge on port 27124)",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cat-pabrik",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfed 4. High-Conversion, Business & Media (S29\u2013S32, S192, S202)\n- `pabrik-ai-access-hub` (22 Cloned AI Tools) \u00b7 `hyper-copywriting-seo`\n- `hypit-viral-video-replicator` (SVML Headless Render)\n- `fleetbase-logistics-supply-chain-os` \u00b7 `enterprise-financial-analyzer`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
