    },
    {
      "id": "node-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd17 Source-to-Claim Evidence Chain\n$$\\text{Claim} \\to \\text{Evidence} \\to \\text{Source} \\to \\text{Quality} \\to \\text{Limitation}$$\n- Zero fabricated statistics or imaginary citations.\n- Real Scopus/WoS/PubMed empirical grounding.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-triple-shield",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Triple Publication Shield Verification\n- **FK-16**: 4-Layer Plagiarism & Similarity Audit (Target $\\le 5\\%$).\n- **FK-17**: 29 AI Pattern Scanner with Natural Humanization.\n- **FK-19**: 100% Authentic DOI & Mendeley/Scopus Citation Validation.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-anti-bias",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 10,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "### \u2696\ufe0f Anti-Bias & Reproducibility Audit\n- Validates mathematical proofs and statistical outputs.\n- Cross-checks code against test suites and edge cases.\n- Zero-regression non-destructive Ponytail discipline.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-self-evolve",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### \ud83e\uddec Continuous Self-Improvement (S78 & S99)\n- Reflexion loop evaluates execution outcomes.\n- LLM-as-a-Judge self-grading rubrics.\n- Updates `13_SELF_IMPROVEMENT` and mutates heuristics.",
      "color": "3"
